# Docker and Dev Container ignore patterns

# Docker build context
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml

# Development containers
**/.devcontainer

# Application data (should be in volumes)
**/data/
**/logs/
**/backups/

# Environment files (create on deployment)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production

# Python cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/pip-log.txt

# IDE files
**/.vscode/settings.json
**/.vscode/launch.json
**/.idea

# OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Testing
**/pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# Build artifacts
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info
